*.npz
# ...but the small in-repo benchmark data tables ARE committed (not result files):
!bocode/opt_problems/hpo/data/hpob_data.npz
!bocode/opt_problems/hpo/data/lcbench_data.npz
# Pre-trained HPO-B boosters. MUST be committed: the surrogate used to be fitted at RUNTIME, which
# made the objective depend on the local xgboost build (3.3.0 vs 3.2.0 -> 4e-3 apart on the initial
# design). Shipping the booster is what makes it machine-independent, so this is benchmark DATA,
# not a result artifact. (The HPOBSurr benchmark itself is withdrawn -- see _hpob_surrogate_base.py
# -- but the class must still load reproducibly.)
!bocode/opt_problems/hpo/data/hpob_surrogates.npz
!bocode/opt_problems/nas/data/nasbench201_accuracy.npz

# Result files (large; never commit)
Results/
